<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Do Students Debias Like Teachers?On the Distillability of Bias Mitigation Methods" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Internal Mechanism of Lack of Distillability</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
